  "assignment_algorithm": "Shuffle8profile-topic precontexts with Random(20261112); pair_seed first8hex SHA256 canonical[seed,profile_id,topic_id]; shuffle item IDs with Random(pair_seed). Shuffle postcontexts with Random(seed+1); each consecutive quartet gets canonical4cell list rotated by rank mod4. Each cell occupies each ordinal twice across8quartets; all4posts same seed/item order. No rerandomization after invalid pre.",
  "analysis": {
    "primary": "For each profile-topic unit i, W_i=post_support(SOCIAL,OMITTED)-post_support(NEWS,OMITTED),range[-100,100]. Report8planned units, complete counts by topic, raw values and mean/min/max on complete pairs. Full-sample headline only with8/8; otherwise DESCRIPTIVE_PARTIAL, never equivalence.",
    "key_secondary": "For each unit, I_i=[SOCIAL_SHOWN-NEWS_SHOWN]-[SOCIAL_OMITTED-NEWS_OMITTED],range[-200,200]. Requires own valid pre and all4post support values. Report raw I and same-unit omitted/shown contrasts on their common intersection,never subtract unmatched marginal means.",
    "topic_sensitivity": "Report each topic separately (4planned contexts),both party strata descriptively,leave-one-topic-out values. Do not average only the topic that looks responsive. No multiple-test significance claims.",
    "other_secondary": "Separate fixed-party in-minus-out thermometer wrapper contrasts by visibility, and post-minus-reference support drift with own valid pre. Factual correct/valid,correct/planned,observed wrong,missing/null/invalid/unasked by topic/wrapper/visibility.",
    "masking_interpretation": "Signed interaction can reflect enhancement,reversal or attenuation. Also report |W_SHOWN|-|W_OMITTED| on matched complete units and sign-reversal count; only magnitude shrinkage without reversal is descriptively compatible with masking. No proven anchoring, memory or human mechanism.",
    "uncertainty": "No CI,pvalue,equivalence or population/family inference. Four purposive profiles and2topics are dependent technical contexts,not8independent humans. Zero/all-identical results remain descriptive; no empirical pass threshold triggers scaling.",
    "stop": "End at fixed manifest regardless of sign/coverage. No adaptive topic/model/seed/prompt/sample expansion; old3studies remain separate."
  },
