    "invalid_pre": "Skip exactly2SHOWN wrapper posts for that profile/topic if own support invalid; retain both OMITTED posts and primary eligibility. Missing unrelated thermometer/comprehension never gates support.",
    "posts": "Wrapper primary requires both OMITTED supports; interaction all4supports and valid pre. Wrong factual answer never excludes support. Report each denominator and skipped/unasked distinct from observed factual errors.",
